# Build artifacts & dependencies — never needed inside the image build context.
# Keeps the router image build lean and fast (context is the repo root).
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/target
**/dist
**/.next
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.scannerwork
**/.sonarlint

# VCS & IDE
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode

# Logs, coverage, local state
**/*.log
**/coverage
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
var